  "description": "Bau is a handsome, hardworking woodcutter living deep in the mountains, brewing rice wine and praying for just one thing: a partner. He begged the Mountain God for a soulmate, but all he got was a thieving water deer trashing his fields. That is, until he finds a man passed out naked next to a broken jar of wine. With sharp fangs and a body built like a god, Bau is certain his prayers have finally been answered and he wastes no time in seducing his guest. What follows is a chaotic, sweet, and incredibly steamy cohabitation. As Bau leads the way with his relentless charms, the two must navigate their new life together and the surprising consequences of their \"divine\" union.\n\n## Notes\n\nIncludes five extra chapters.",
